      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "field",
          "text": "Rowan notices that the plan contains not only a route, but a clear sign that would make you abandon it. He treats that not as timidity, but as a normal part of any work where conditions can change before you do.",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "kind": "any",
              "conditions": [
                {
                  "kind": "schoolCounter",
                  "track": "school.track.field_craft",
                  "counter": "lessons_completed",
                  "op": "gte",
                  "value": 1
                },
                {
                  "kind": "schoolCounter",
                  "track": "school.track.field_craft",
                  "counter": "night_study_sessions",
                  "op": "gte",
                  "value": 1
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "media": []
        },
        {
          "id": "rhetoric",
          "text": "Cassian rewrites one of your lines and shows how easily a question can reveal the answer you hope to hear. You try again—this time the other person has to give their own account instead of confirming yours.",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "kind": "any",
              "conditions": [
                {
                  "kind": "schoolCounter",
                  "track": "school.track.rhetoric_and_social",
                  "counter": "lessons_completed",
                  "op": "gte",
                  "value": 1
                },
                {
                  "kind": "schoolCounter",
                  "track": "school.track.rhetoric_and_social",
                  "counter": "night_study_sessions",
                  "op": "gte",
                  "value": 1
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "media": []
        },
        {
          "id": "etiquette",
          "text": "Eliane notes that an overprepared manner can begin attracting attention on its own. She asks you to remove the excess and keep only what genuinely fits the place and role.",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "kind": "any",
              "conditions": [
                {
                  "kind": "schoolCounter",
                  "track": "school.track.etiquette_and_presentation",
                  "counter": "lessons_completed",
                  "op": "gte",
                  "value": 1
                },
                {
                  "kind": "schoolCounter",
                  "track": "school.track.etiquette_and_presentation",
                  "counter": "night_study_sessions",
                  "op": "gte",
                  "value": 1
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "media": []
        },
        {
          "id": "literacy",
          "text": "Mara approves a timeline in which an unknown span has not been filled with an elegant guess. A marked gap is more useful than invented precision because it shows what information still needs to be found.",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "kind": "any",
              "conditions": [
                {
                  "kind": "schoolCounter",
                  "track": "school.track.literacy_and_numbers",
                  "counter": "lessons_completed",
                  "op": "gte",
                  "value": 1
                },
                {
                  "kind": "schoolCounter",
                  "track": "school.track.literacy_and_numbers",
                  "counter": "night_study_sessions",
                  "op": "gte",
                  "value": 1
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "media": []
        },
        {
          "id": "physical",
          "text": "Tovan evaluates not speed, but the ability to move quietly, change direction, and stop without losing balance. This is general body control, not combat or attack training.",
